From dc900dc192b2f62fc2546046edf3089258e6cfb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:50:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add n-table-convert.sh; teach n-table-align.awk about escaped
 pipes

n-table-convert.sh converts CSV, TSV, or JSON on stdin into a Markdown
or Org table, aligned by n-table-align.awk. Named after Emacs'
org-table-convert-region.

n-table-align.awk no longer splits a cell on an escaped pipe (\|), the
GFM way to put a literal pipe in a cell. Tables without \| align
exactly as before.
